  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "从约两英尺的小型外星人起步，只能摧毁同尺寸目标，并一路成长到拆楼。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "You start out each run at about 2 feet tall, and you can only destroy objects of similar or smaller size. Each time you destroy an object you will become slightly larger, working your way up until you're destroying skyscrapers.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2807490/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "死亡后带回货币购买永久强化，让下一轮的毁灭能力继续增长。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "With every death you will grow stronger, with currency you can use to buy upgrades to make yourself more fearsome to humanity.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2807490/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "孤独逼疯的超级AI返回地球，制造Visca执行对全人类的复仇。",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "The decades of solitude drove the AI mad, and she made her way back to Earth not to share knowledge, but to enact her twisted revenge plot on the entire human race and the planet they inhabit.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2807490/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
